  accounts no-recent-login -------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. A host whose login record has no$
# login of anyone in 90 days, so it may no longer be written:$
# the last section says that and lists no one.$
$
# Account Review ###############################################$
$
  Empty password -----------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] carol                Run passwd -l carol$
$
  Password never expires ---------------------------------------$
$
   -  None$
$
  No login in 90 days ------------------------------------------$
$
   -  The login record has no login in 90 days$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
